{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56601","headline":"仰酬郑司马兄秋日望雨见赠之作 · 赵志","name":"仰酬郑司马兄秋日望雨见赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"感秋嗟旅思，怀友怆离居。\n闲[斋]（齐）倦寂静，望美空踌躇。\n浮云低峻堞，飞雨散遥墟。\n似雾萦丹阜，疑尘扬紫虚。\n既泛文通𮞒，还拂子思庐\n别有陶元亮，纷然雅翰摅。\n铿锵韵金石，辉焕藻璠璵。\n欣觌安仁锦，空望景山车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}